	(text "USB-C port A on the core (sink only, 5.1 kOhm Rd on CC1/CC2; CC1/CC2 also to MCU analog inputs for the source's\ncurrent advertisement). Port B arrives from the switch board through the castellated contacts (its ESD sits there).\nTPS2121 picks VBUS: port A while VBUS_A > 4.0 V, else port B; cut-off above 5.9 V, limit 3.5 A. Its ST pin\n(USB_SEL, high = port A) switches the TS3USB221A, so the data comes from the port that powers the board (CORE-066)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20764656-3ea7-5926-8b77-8d8c6dc50aff")
